# Require manual reload.
# We don't use the devShell that often,
# but frequently modify flake.nix
nix_direnv_manual_reload

# ca-derivations (enabled system-wide in system/modules/nix.nix) makes Nix
# treat the mkShell derivation as content-addressed, which trips a Nix 2.25
# bug ("derivation has incorrect deferred output / environment variable 'out'")
# when evaluating the devShell. Scope the feature off for just this eval.
use flake . --option experimental-features "nix-command flakes"